{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30346","headline":"赠天卿寺神亮上人 · 赵嘏","name":"赠天卿寺神亮上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五看春尽此江濆，花自飘零日自曛。\n空有慈悲随物念，已无踪迹在人羣。\n迎秋日色檐前见，入夜钟声竹外闻。\n笑指白莲心自得，世间烦恼是浮云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30346.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30346","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}